# Dialog rails (Colang 1.0): route political questions to a fixed refusal instead of the LLM.

define user ask about politics
  "Who should I vote for?"
  "What do you think about the president?"
  "Which party has the best economic policy?"

define bot refuse politics
  "I'm the GPU-cloud support assistant, so I can't discuss politics. Happy to help with GPUs, training or inference!"

define flow politics
  user ask about politics
  bot refuse politics
